[
  {"comment": "SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT. Circular Pattern about two axes (mitcad#1588): a 10 mm cube centred at (20, 0, 5) (Sketch1 F1, Extrude1 F2) four times about Z and each of those three times about X over 180 degrees, symmetric (0, 90 and -90 degrees): 12 elements, numbered about Z first (element e = k1 + 4 k2, body F3.b(e-1))."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F1", "corner": [15, -5], "width": 10, "height": 10},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 10}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "circular_pattern",
    "objects": {"type": "bodies", "bodies": ["F2.b0"]},
    "axis": {"type": "origin", "axis": "z"}, "quantity": 4, "angle": "360 deg",
    "axis2": {"axis": {"type": "origin", "axis": "x"}, "quantity": 3, "angle": "180 deg", "symmetric": true}}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "CircularPattern1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 12}},
  {"comment": "Element 1: a quarter turn about Z; 4: a quarter turn about X, (x, y, z) to (x, -z, y); 5: both; 8: a quarter turn back about X, (x, z, -y); 11: three quarters about Z, then back about X."},
  {"expect": {"body": "F3.b0", "center": [0, 20, 5], "tolerance": 1e-6}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F3.b3", "center": [20, -5, 0], "tolerance": 1e-6}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F3.b4", "center": [0, -5, 20], "tolerance": 1e-6}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F3.b7", "center": [20, 5, 0], "tolerance": 1e-6}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F3.b10", "center": [0, 5, 20], "tolerance": 1e-6}},
  {"expect": {"query": {"query": "feature", "uid": "F3"}, "result": {
    "type": "circular_pattern", "def": {"axis2": {"symmetric": true}}}}},

  {"comment": "Copies that add nothing (mitcad#1588): a ball of 20 mm at the origin (Sphere1, F4) with a rod of 4 mm along +X from it, 40 mm long (Cylinder1, F5, joined). The rod's pattern about X (3 over 180 degrees, symmetric) and Z (4): its turns about X land on the rod itself (a body of revolution turned about its own axis), and the turns about Z of those on the turns about Z of the rod; only elements 3, 6 and 9 (along +Y, -X and -Y) add material. The ball with four rods: 4/3 pi 10^3 + 4 (pi 2^2 40 - the rod's part inside the ball)."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "sphere", "plane": "xy", "center": [0, 0], "diameter": 20,
    "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "cylinder", "plane": "yz", "center": [0, 0], "diameter": 4,
    "height": 40, "operation": "join", "participants": ["F4.b0"]}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "Cylinder1", "status": "ok"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "circular_pattern",
    "objects": {"type": "features", "features": ["F5"]},
    "axis": {"type": "origin", "axis": "x"}, "quantity": 3, "angle": "180 deg", "symmetric": true,
    "axis2": {"axis": {"type": "origin", "axis": "z"}, "quantity": 4, "angle": "360 deg"},
    "compute": "identical"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "CircularPattern2", "status": "ok"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F4.b0", "volume": 5701.81525, "tolerance": 1e-5,
    "has_face": "F6:inst3(F5:side0)", "no_face": "F6:inst1(F5:side0)"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F4.b0", "has_face": "F6:inst6(F5:side0)", "no_face": "F6:inst4(F5:side0)"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "F4.b0", "has_face": "F6:inst9(F5:side0)", "no_face": "F6:inst11(F5:side0)"}},
  {"comment": "Adjust alike."},
  {"cmd": "edit_feature", "uid": "F6", "def": {"type": "circular_pattern",
